:''Not to be confused with [[Aku Gory]].''
'''Demon Gory''' (鬼化ゴリさん, ''Onika Gori-san'', '''Demonized Gori-san''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 15.1 Update#Version 15.1.1 Update|Version 15.1.1]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Demon Gory
|image = E 765.png
|first appearance = [[Fight for Life]]
|money drop = 550¢ - 2,172¢
}}

==Enemy==
This variant of [[Gory]] with an ''oni'' horn has stats comparable to a 300% HP Gory with 375% attack power, but it also has a [[Wave Attack#Mini-Wave|Mini-Wave]] to deal piercing damage.

==Strategy==
While it's not too threatening at first glance since its stats are in between that of [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 2 and 3 Gories, do keep in mind that this enemy has a way to chip down your midrangers and backliners, especially in higher magnifications.

